cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use pkpdsim, please cite it as below."
title: "pkpdsim: building blocks of physiologically based pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic models in SBML"
abstract: "pkpdsim provides the building blocks shared by physiologically based pharmacokinetic and pharmacodynamic (PBPK/PD) models in SBML: the creators and terms of use of a model, the annotations of recurring compartments, the collection of study data from PK-DB, the initial values of a substance in every tissue and the license texts of the COMBINE archive of a model. It also provides the model object and the commands of a model (run, fit, report, identifiability), the tests of a model as functions and the verification of a change (pkpdsim-verify)."
